---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <Nav activePage="career-guidance" />

  <section id="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <div class="orb orb-gold"></div>
      <div class="orb orb-teal"></div>
      <div class="grid"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services">Services</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance">Career Counselling and Guidance</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href={BOFU_INTERNAL_LINKS.guidanceLocations}>Locations</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Career Counselling in Jaipur</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="pill hero-pill">
        <span class="pill-dot"></span>
        Practical support for students, freshers, and working professionals in Jaipur
      </div>

      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Career counselling in Jaipur
        <span class="gold-text"> for practical clarity and stronger next steps</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Jaipur hands many people a genuinely different fork than most Indian cities: a large, globally connected gems-and-jewellery and heritage-tourism economy built around the Pink City and Johari Bazaar, running alongside a real and growing IT-ITES corridor centred on Sitapura and the Mahindra World City SEZ. Most career advice available online is written for a single generic city and misses both. If you are at a real decision point, the goal is getting clear before more time goes the wrong way, and building the kind of high-value skill portfolio that unlocks high income opportunities and moves you toward earlier financial freedom.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-note">
        Guidance is delivered fully online in Jaipur and across India. You can start from home, hostel, workshop, or office - no travel, no waiting for local availability.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-gold pulse">Get Student Career Counselling</a>
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-outline">Get Working Professional Career Counselling</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-support">
        The stronger filter is not only whether the search started with Jaipur. It is whether the guidance improves the next move enough to matter.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <BofuListCardSection
    sectionId="local-intent-fit"
    title="Why this decision already feels important"
    subtitle="You want support that feels easier to trust, easier to start, and more useful than generic advice - not another vague conversation."
    items={fitItems}
    variant="contrast"
  >
    <BofuSummaryStrip items={fitSummaryItems} variant="contrast" />
  </BofuListCardSection>

  <ContextualCta
    audience="mixed"
    title="If the Jaipur search already reflects a serious decision, move before more time goes into the wrong direction"
    body="Use this when you want stronger guidance now, not another round of delay while the decision keeps getting more expensive."
    studentHref="#plans"
    studentLabel="Get Student Career Counselling"
    professionalHref="#plans"
    professionalLabel="Get Working Professional Career Counselling"
  />

  <BofuFeatureSection
    sectionId="heritage-economy"
    title="The gems, jewellery, and heritage-tourism economy is Jaipur's first real fork"
    subtitle="No other city sibling carries this density of gems-export and heritage-tourism trade in one place - it deserves a specific answer, not a generic tourism mention."
    items={heritageEconomyItems}
    variant="decision"
  >
    <BofuSummaryStrip items={heritageEconomySummaryItems} variant="neutral" />
  </BofuFeatureSection>

  <BofuListCardSection
    sectionId="it-economy"
    title="Sitapura and Mahindra World City: a second, genuinely different economy"
    subtitle="A real, growing professional economy under its own pressures, and a genuine choice between it and the heritage-trade economy."
    items={itEconomyItems}
    columns={2}
    variant="contrast"
  >
    <BofuSummaryStrip items={itEconomySummaryItems} variant="neutral" />
  </BofuListCardSection>

  <BofuFeatureSection
    sectionId="jaipur-areas"
    title="Jaipur's areas point to different real decisions"
    subtitle="A useful local page should feel grounded in how people actually live and work across Jaipur, not treat it as one flat generic location."
    items={areaItems}
    variant="decision"
  />

  <BofuListCardSection
    sectionId="city-page-vs-broader-guidance"
    title="Choose the stronger starting point for your situation"
    subtitle="For some people, local, Jaipur-specific support is the easiest way to start. For others, broader guidance across paths and skills is the better fit because the decision itself is already the bigger issue."
    items={cityDecisionItems}
    columns={2}
    variant="contrast"
  >
    <BofuSummaryStrip items={cityDecisionSummaryItems} variant="neutral" />
  </BofuListCardSection>

  <GuidanceModelSection
    sectionId="guidance-process"
    title="How practical guidance should move the decision forward"
    subtitle="The point is not a vague conversation. The point is better decisions, higher-value skill direction, proof of work, and a clearer path toward income growth."
  />

  <ComparisonMatrix
    sectionId="comparison"
    title="What makes this more useful than generic counselling"
    subtitle="In a city where a heritage-trade path and an IT-ITES role can each look like the obvious default, the risk is advice that ignores where you actually are. The comparison below shows what separates high-leverage guidance from generic career counselling."
    rows={jaipurComparisonRows}
    centered={true}
  />

